{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104783","id":2427357431,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Qroj3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104783","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104783.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104783.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104783","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104783/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104783/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104783/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c5b1736e3da75774c6683431c6583609768f58c6","number":104783,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix issue with improper notifications in propagate function","user":{"login":"vaeleborne","id":114700444,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtYwnA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114700444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne","html_url":"https://github.com/vaeleborne","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaeleborne/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes: #83160 \r\n\r\nThe issue was two-fold. First: NOTIFICATION_PAUSED and NOTIFICATION_UNPAUSED were not being sent if Process Mode was set to Always, see #104778, secondly and directly related in the logic, the wrong notification was being sent when Process Mode was set to when paused.\r\n\r\nFor Clarity: Now when Process Mode is Always, When_Paused, or Pausable, if when we pause the correct value of NOTIFICATION_PAUSED (14) is sent, when unpausing NOTIFICATION_UNPAUSED (15) is sent.\r\n\r\nThis PR corrects the logic and ensures that the proper notification is being sent, and is sent in all process modes it should be, (so not in disabled). \r\n\r\nTested by running the mrp from #104778 \r\n\r\nEDIT: Per comments, reworked so notifications are only being sent when Process Mode is either When_Paused or Pausable and ensured that they are both being sent the correct notification each time now by testing the p_enable to determine which message to send rather than checking the prev_can_process and next_can_process variables.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A